WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.600
Lean and Mathlib

00:00:01.411 --> 00:00:02.897
communities certify

00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:04.772
Alpöge's 17-million-line

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:05.491
Lean proof

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.067
A joint statement

00:00:06.879 --> 00:00:07.881
endorsed by the

00:00:07.693 --> 00:00:08.883
Lean FRO and

00:00:08.695 --> 00:00:09.968
the Mathlib Initiative

00:00:10.039 --> 00:00:11.088
says the community

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.409
checked Levent Alpöge's

00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:13.164
Lean proof of

00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:14.379
the Riemann Hypothesis

00:00:14.355 --> 00:00:15.298
and is fully

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.124
confident it is

00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:16.655
correct

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:18.373
Alpöge released the

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.764
proof on November 20

00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:20.448
as a Lean

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:21.733
library of 17

00:00:21.545 --> 00:00:22.594
million lines that

00:00:22.406 --> 00:00:23.656
depends only on

00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:24.257
Mathlib

00:00:24.782 --> 00:00:25.749
Over the past

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:26.055
day

00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:27.057
the Lean and

00:00:26.869 --> 00:00:28.142
Mathlib communities

00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:28.897
have rallied to

00:00:28.709 --> 00:00:30.029
verify the proof's

00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:30.772
correctness

00:00:31.302 --> 00:00:32.316
Full story on

00:00:32.127 --> 00:00:33.023
the dashboard
